   SubPlan expr_1
     ->  Custom Scan (TessAgg)
           ->  Custom Scan (TessFilter) on index_i
                 Batch Filter: ((index_i.k >= (y.y * 1000)) AND (index_i.k <= ((y.y * 1000) + 4000)))
                 ->  Custom Scan (TessHeapScan) on index_i
                       ->  Index Only Scan using index_i_k on index_i
                             Index Cond: ((k >= (y.y * 1000)) AND (k <= ((y.y * 1000) + 4000)))
